{{also|Fragen}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From Middle High German {{term|vragen|vrāgen|lang=gmh}}, from Old High German {{term|fragen|frāgēn|lang=goh}}, {{term|frahen|frahēn/frāhēn|lang=goh}}, which is indirectly derived from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{recons|fregnanan|lang=gem-pro}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{recons|preḱ-||to ask|lang=ine-pro}}.<ref>{{R:EWddS|ed=22|hw=Frage, fragen}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|De-fragen.ogg|audio}}
* {{rhymes|a:gn̩|lang=de}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb}}

# to [[ask]]

====Conjugation====
{{de-conj-weak|frag|gefragt|h}}
Note there is another preterite form which has 'frug' as a stem instead of 'fragte'. That one is older.

